      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Note: Deploying both Solr-4.10.3 and Fuseki-2.4.0 in the same Tomcat creates a dependency conflict on slf4j, since our Solr deployment puts the slf4j jars in /usr/share/tomcat7/lib.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant-base-box/blob/master/install_scripts/solr.sh#L35"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant-base-box/blob/master/install_scripts/solr.sh#L35",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "We could move away from deploying Solr in Tomcat, or instead put a different version of slf4j in /usr/share/tomcat7/lib... i.e. the slf4j version that Fuseki contains in WEB-INF/lib.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
