     "body": "<p>Note: Deploying both Solr-4.10.3 and Fuseki-2.4.0 in the same Tomcat creates a dependency conflict on slf4j, since our Solr deployment puts the slf4j jars in /usr/share/tomcat7/lib.<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant-base-box/blob/master/install_scripts/solr.sh#L35\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant-base-box/blob/master/install_scripts/solr.sh#L35</a></p>\n\n<p>We could move away from deploying Solr in Tomcat, or instead put a different version of slf4j in /usr/share/tomcat7/lib... i.e. the slf4j version that Fuseki contains in WEB-INF/lib.</p>",
